    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "Greenish light flickers between the iron plates, casting a sickly hue upon the ground. A sharp chill emanates from the metal, offering a grim defense against the foulest toxins of the wild. It crackles with a latent, stinging energy when the air grows still."
